;   source 0 = Tile_88 (full X-brace grate body — fill for ceiling/wall/interior)
;   source 1 = Tile_85 (rail-capped grate — top surface of floor/ledges/step)
; Native tile is 128x128; the TileMapLayer is scaled 0.5 so each cell = 64 world px.

